VALUES ('Space Florida – UK Space Agency Space Innovation Partnership Call', 'Joint Space Florida / UK Space Agency call (first under the Florida International Aerospace Innovation Fund partnership, launched Sep 29, 2026) for collaborative Florida-UK space R&D with strong market potential, especially in-orbit servicing/manufacturing, space transportation, satellite systems, in-space research and advanced exploration. One joint identical proposal must be submitted to both funders by Jan 11, 2027 (5:00 p.m. ET to Space Florida, 3:00 p.m. GMT to UKSA); evaluation Jan-Mar 2027, funding from May 2027, up to two projects. Distinct from the generic Space Florida pin — this is the specific bilateral program.', 'government_grant', 'physical', '505 Odyssey Way, Suite 300, Exploration Park, FL 32953', 'Merritt Island', 'United States', 28.51486, -80.6695, 'https://www.spaceflorida.gov/news/space-florida-uk-space-agency-launch-joint-call-for-space-innovation-projects', 'info@spaceflorida.gov', true, false, ARRAY['research','mvp','validation','launch']::text[],
 'Funding pool up to $200,000 from Space Florida and £150,000 from UKSA; up to two projects, each with a total value of £150,000/$200,000 including contributions of up to $100,000 (Space Florida) and up to £75,000 (UKSA)', 200000, '2027-01-11T23:59:59-04:00', false, 'open', NULL, NULL,
