VALUES ('NOAA SBIR Phase I (FY27)', 'NOAA SBIR (Technology Partnerships Office) annual Phase I grant for highly innovative, commercially viable products/services in NOAA mission areas, applied for once per year via the NOFO on Grants.gov. As of Oct 27, 2026 the official Funding Opportunities page states: ''The next Notice of Funding Opportunity (NOFO), for FY27, will be updated on this page. The NOAA SBIR team is targeting a November 1st release'' — no FY27 application deadline or amount published yet, hence opening_soon with deadline null.', 'government_grant', 'physical', '1315 East-West Highway, Silver Spring, MD 20910', 'Silver Spring', 'United States', 38.99246, -77.03063, 'https://techpartnerships.noaa.gov/sbir/fundingopportunities/', 'noaa.sbir@noaa.gov', true, false, ARRAY['research','mvp','validation']::text[],
 'FY27 amount not yet published; most recent official Phase I NOFO (FY25) was up to $190,000 for 6 months (supersedes the older $175,000 listing)', 190000, NULL, false, 'opening_soon', NULL, NULL,
