VALUES ('BIRD Foundation – US-Israel Binational Industrial R&D (General Program)', 'BIRD (Binational Industrial Research and Development) Foundation conditional grants for joint R&D between two unrelated companies, one registered in the US and one in Israel, for a jointly developed innovative technology/product with significant commercial potential; funding is repaid only via royalties if the product commercializes, with no equity or IP taken. Full proposals (by invitation after Executive Summary) are due Jan 21, 2027, with approvals expected March 2027.', 'government_grant', 'physical', 'Park Atidim, Building 4, Kiryat Atidim, Tel Aviv 6158001', 'Tel Aviv', 'Israel', 32.10696, 34.83405, 'https://www.birdf.com/bird_programs/bird-general-program/', NULL, true, false, ARRAY['research','mvp','validation','launch']::text[],
