VALUES ('She Believed She Could Foundation — Iconic Impact Grants (Emerging Founder Grant)', 'Annual Orlando/Winter Park, FL grant program confirmed on the official She Believed She Could site: two women are selected each year (an Impact Leader for nonprofit leaders and an Emerging Founder for early-stage female entrepreneurs). Each recipient receives a $2,500 cash grant plus a $7,500-value Next Chapter Intensive, visibility and community; the 2026 window ran Aug 20–Sep 30, 2026 with recipients announced Nov 5, 2026 at ICONIC IMPACT in Winter Park, so the 2026 window is closed and the program is watchlist for the expected 2027 cycle. Free to apply.', 'government_grant', 'physical', 'Orlando, Florida, USA', 'Orlando', 'United States', 28.5383, -81.3792, 'https://www.shebelievedshecould.co/impact-grant', NULL, true, false, ARRAY['validation','launch','growth']::text[],
 '$2,500 cash grant per recipient, plus a $7,500-value strategy intensive (total package valued over $10,000)', 2500, NULL, false, 'watchlist', NULL, NULL,
