VALUES ('Awesome Foundation — Miami Chapter Monthly Micro-Grants', 'The Awesome Foundation''s Miami, FL chapter awards monthly grants of up to $1,000, no strings attached, to creators, big-thinkers and new ventures in Miami; applications are reviewed monthly with deadlines on the 15th of every month, judged on joy, innovation, staying power, environmental impact, local impact and value. Free to apply; individuals, groups and companies are eligible and no 501(c)(3) status is required.', 'government_grant', 'physical', 'Miami, Florida, USA', 'Miami', 'United States', 25.7617, -80.1918, 'http://www.awesomefoundation.org/en/chapters/miami', NULL, true, false, ARRAY['idea','validation','launch']::text[],
