VALUES ('CareerSource Florida — Incumbent Worker Training (IWT) Grant Program FY2026-27', 'Florida''s IWT program reimburses existing Florida businesses for training current full-time employees; this is a specific IWT program record (separate from the generic CareerSource QRT pin). The CareerSource Florida board approved a $3 million FY2026-27 set-aside for IWT on June 11, 2026 (official careersourceflorida.com release). Reimbursement is 50% of preapproved direct training costs, up to 75% for priority small businesses (25 or fewer employees), capped at $100,000 per company, with training completed within 12 months; applications are taken through careersourceflorida.com until a funds-exhausted notice is posted. Free to apply.', 'government_grant', 'hybrid', 'Tallahassee, Florida, USA', 'Tallahassee', 'United States', 30.4383, -84.2807, 'https://careersourceflorida.com/2026/06/11/careersource-florida-board-of-directors-advances-workforce-investments-employer-engagement-and-strategic-initiatives/', NULL, true, false, ARRAY['launch','growth']::text[],
 'Reimbursement of 50% of preapproved training costs (up to 75% for priority small businesses), up to $100,000 per company; $3M statewide FY2026-27 set-aside', 100000, NULL, true, 'open', NULL, NULL,
 ARRAY['florida','workforce_training','for_profit','employer','free_to_apply']::text[], ARRAY['all','technology','healthcare','manufacturing']::text[], ARRAY['small_business_employer']::text[], '{}', false, false, 'FL', 'https://careersourceflorida.com/2026/06/11/careersource-florida-board-of-directors-advances-workforce-investments-employer-engagement-and-strategic-initiatives/', '2026-10-27T00:00:00-04:00')
