VALUES ('U.S. Chamber of Commerce Foundation — Readiness for Resiliency (R4R) Mitigation Grant', 'New grant launched by the U.S. Chamber of Commerce Foundation with Verizon (founding partner FedEx; partners Fiserv and MetLife), announced on the Foundation''s official site on October 27, 2026: $5,000 grants for small businesses to fund a disaster-mitigation project (power continuity, communications redundancy, flood/water intrusion, structural or equipment protection) — highly relevant to Florida hurricane risk. To apply, complete the Foundation''s disaster preparedness checklist and a free Disaster Resilience course on Verizon Small Business Digital Ready; applicants are automatically registered for a further $5,000 R4R recovery grant if a qualifying disaster hits their region. Recipients notified by January 15, 2027; projects completed by April 30, 2027. Free to apply.', 'government_grant', 'online', 'Washington, District of Columbia, USA', 'Washington', 'United States', 38.8951, -77.0363, 'https://www.uschamberfoundation.org/disasters/new-grant-program-helps-small-businesses-prepare-for-natural-disasters', NULL, true, false, ARRAY['launch','growth']::text[],
 '$5,000 (plus automatic registration for an additional $5,000 disaster-recovery grant if a qualifying disaster hits the region)', 5000, '2026-11-15T23:59:59-04:00', false, 'open', NULL, NULL,
 ARRAY['us_small_business','disaster_resilience','florida_relevant','free_to_apply']::text[], ARRAY['all']::text[], ARRAY['small_business']::text[], '{}', false, false, 'FL', 'https://www.uschamberfoundation.org/disasters/new-grant-program-helps-small-businesses-prepare-for-natural-disasters', '2026-10-27T00:00:00-04:00')
